Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT}}

{
  "addressId": 1,
  "name": "Kuka Jefferson"
 
}

### public

GET http://localhost:3000/user/address

### client, driver y vendor siempre y cuando las ordenes pertenezcan a ellos

GET http://localhost:3000/user/70/orders
