### Contacto con soporte (no requiere rol)

POST  http://localhost:3000/support/contact
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT}}

{
  "supportCategory": "ORDER",
  "description": "No anda wachin"
}

### ver mensajes de soporte de mi perfil

GET http://localhost:3000/support/my-requests/69
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT}}

### solo admin

PUT http://localhost:3000/support/70/response
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT}}

{
  "status": "RESOLVED",
  "adminComment":"Gracias por contactarnos, ahi hemos solucionado el error"
}

### solo admin

GET http://localhost:3000/support/requests?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT}}


